From: Shaun Adams <s.adams@f5.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Jun 2026 22:37:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] transports: introduce BifrostRouter interface +
 SingleTenantRouter scaffolding
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

First half of the per-tenant Bifrost dispatch work, split off from the
multi-tenant activation patch for review tractability.

Adds:
  - lib.BifrostRouter — one-method interface, Acquire(ctx) → (*Bifrost,
    release, error). The contract pairs Acquire with a mandatory
    release() so a future multi-tenant router can decrement its
    per-tenant refcount via defer in the entry-point handlers.
  - lib.SingleTenantRouter — trivial impl that always serves the same
    *bifrost.Bifrost with a noop release. Used by OSS / single-tenant
    deployments; multi-tenant deployments will inject their own router
    in the next patch.

Plumbs the router into the three inference handler structs:
  - CompletionHandler
  - AsyncHandler
  - MCPInferenceHandler

Each gains a `router lib.BifrostRouter` field initialized to a
SingleTenantRouter, plus a *WithRouter constructor variant that lets
callers inject a custom router. The legacy `client *bifrost.Bifrost`
field is preserved as a back-pointer for hot-reload / shutdown paths
that read the runtime directly; the per-request inference path is
NOT rewritten in this patch (call sites stay on h.client.X for now).
The next patch swaps the per-request path to use router.Acquire +
defer release alongside the multi-tenant activation.

Two fix-ups folded in:
  - MockConfigStore in lib/config_test.go gets the 6 tenant CRUD
    methods added by patch 0011 (it was missing them — the lib test
    suite didn't compile against the post-0011 ConfigStore
    interface).
  - TestConfigSchemaSync's exclusion list gains `tenant_id` on each
    tenant-scoped table (patches 0007/0008) and `source_id` on
    TableTeam (pre-existing vesdev field). tenant_id is internal DB
    scoping, never appears in config.json.

Tests:
  - lib/router_test.go: 5 new TestSingleTenantRouter_* covering happy
    path, concurrent Acquire safety, SetClient swap, nil-client panics
  - lib + handler test suites pass after the changes

Ref: https://jira.f5net.com/browse/XC-25496
